        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873860/extras/ea538e152e41c93cdffa10c7f21a64f1.avif?t=1781365758\" width=480 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873860/extras/d0b5f3107cef28b519b229956e0b759f.webp?t=1781365758\" width=336 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique puzzle categories</strong>. There are currently nine themed categories with a total of 81 puzzles, and more to come with each update!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Sudoku puzzles</strong>. Choose between farming elements or standard numbers for your puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play at your own level</strong>. Options available to hide the timer, highlight rows and columns, or automatically show incorrect answers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles, get coins</strong>. Each puzzle gets you acorns to use to expand your farm! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adopt animals</strong>. Spend acorns to summon new animals to your farm! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your farm</strong>. Decorate your farm how you see fit! Choose seasons, time of day, weather, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original music</strong>. Composed exclusively with DX7 patches to give a retro vibe to the soundtrack!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873860/extras/ea538e152e41c93cdffa10c7f21a64f1.avif?t=1781365758\" width=480 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873860/extras/d0b5f3107cef28b519b229956e0b759f.webp?t=1781365758\" width=336 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique puzzle categories</strong>. There are currently nine themed categories with a total of 81 puzzles, and more to come with each update!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Sudoku puzzles</strong>. Choose between farming elements or standard numbers for your puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play at your own level</strong>. Options available to hide the timer, highlight rows and columns, or automatically show incorrect answers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles, get coins</strong>. Each puzzle gets you acorns to use to expand your farm! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adopt animals</strong>. Spend acorns to summon new animals to your farm! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your farm</strong>. Decorate your farm how you see fit! Choose seasons, time of day, weather, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original music</strong>. Composed exclusively with DX7 patches to give a retro vibe to the soundtrack!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Sudoku Acres is a cozy cross-up of farm building and puzzle solving. Grow your skills and your environment as you complete Sudoku puzzles, acquire animals, and unlock decorations for your farm!",
